WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.420
The register of certificates, inspections and licences, what is overdue, and recording a renewal.

2
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:14.850
Safety & licences keeps every certificate, inspection and licence the mall needs, with its next due date.

3
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:22.660
At the top: what is overdue, what falls due soon, and tenants whose insurance is missing or expired.

4
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:28.980
Filter by type: civil defence, fire alarm, lifts, licences and more.

5
00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:33.280
Back to everything. Overdue items come first.

6
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:39.740
Open an item when the test, inspection or renewal has been done.

7
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:44.920
Record it here: the date, the result and who did it.

8
00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:56.170
Add the certificate number. Leave the next due date empty: it is worked out from how often it repeats.

9
00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:59.440
Record it as done.

10
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:05.530
Then upload the certificate, so it is at hand when the inspector visits.

11
00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.470
The 12-month calendar shows everything falling due this year, and reminders go out before each date.
